<title>USA: Amrion board authorizes buyback.</title>
<headline>Amrion board authorizes buyback.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amrion Inc said Friday its directors had authorized the repurchase of up to 250,000 shares in open market transactions.</p>
<p>Amrion develops, manufactures, markets and sells nutriceuticals, herbal formulas and other nutritional supplements through four principal divisions and its subsidiary, Natrix International LLC.</p>
